---
import { appStore } from '../config/site';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hans">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" />
    <title>Posturely 首页设计原型 V4</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Posturely 首页独立设计原型，仅用于内部评审。" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://posturely.daimmd.com/prototype-v4/" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="prototype">
      <header class="topbar">
        <button class="language" type="button" aria-label="切换语言">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M3.5 9h17M3.5 15h17M12 3c2.2 2.5 3.4 5.5 3.4 9S14.2 18.5 12 21M12 3C9.8 5.5 8.6 8.5 8.6 12S9.8 18.5 12 21"></path></svg>
        </button>
        <a class="brand" href="/zh/" aria-label="Posturely 首页">
          <img src="/images/posturely-app-icon.png" width="192" height="192" alt="" />
          <span>Posturely</span>
        </a>
        <a class="header-cta" href={appStore.url}>前往 App Store <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </header>

      <main>
        <section class="hero">
          <div class="hero-copy">
            <p class="kicker"><span></span> iPhone 坐姿提醒 App</p>
            <h1>继续专注。<br />坐姿变化时，<br /><em>iPhone 会提醒你。</em></h1>
            <p class="hero-intro">Posturely 在设备本地留意持续的低头、前倾与倾斜变化，需要时用声音或震动，轻轻把注意力带回身体。</p>
            <a class="primary-cta" href={appStore.url}>前往 App Store <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            <p class="cta-note">无需穿戴设备 · 摄像头画面不上传</p>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-instrument" aria-label="Posturely 在 iPhone 上运行的产品画面">
            <div class="instrument-toolbar">
              <span>POSTURE SESSION</span>
              <span class="live"><i></i> 监督待开始</span>
            </div>
            <img src="/images/posturely-product-hero-real-app-v2.jpg" width="1536" height="1024" alt="Posturely 在桌面支架上的 iPhone 中运行" />
            <div class="calibration-orbit" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
            <div class="session-chip time"><small>监督时长</small><strong>40:00</strong></div>
            <div class="session-chip privacy"><small>处理位置</small><strong>此设备</strong></div>
            <svg class="posture-trace" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 200 350" fill="none">
              <path class="trace-line" d="M97 24c-28 1-43 23-39 48 4 23 20 30 37 32v36l-40 28-19 88M99 104l44 39 19 109M57 168l42 26 44-51M99 194v111M52 278l47 27 51-27"></path>
              {[[97,24],[58,72],[95,104],[57,168],[143,143],[99,194],[36,256],[162,252],[52,278],[99,305],[150,278]].map(([cx,cy]) => <circle cx={cx} cy={cy} r="5"></circle>)}
            </svg>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="fact-rail" aria-label="产品特点">
          <article><span>01</span><div><strong>无需穿戴</strong><p>只需要桌面上的 iPhone 或 iPad。</p></div></article>
          <article><span>02</span><div><strong>按变化提醒</strong><p>姿态持续偏离本次参考时再提示。</p></div></article>
          <article><span>03</span><div><strong>设备本地处理</strong><p>用于检测的摄像头画面不会上传。</p></div></article>
        </section>

        <section class="thesis section-pad">
          <div class="thesis-index">POSTURELY / 00</div>
          <div class="thesis-copy">
            <p class="eyebrow">提醒的意义</p>
            <h2>它不评价你的姿势。<br />它只告诉你：<br /><span>变化发生了。</span></h2>
            <p>深度专注时，身体的小变化很容易退到注意力之外。Posturely 把这条信息带回来，是否调整、怎样调整，仍然由你决定。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="awareness-dial" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="dial-ring r1"></div><div class="dial-ring r2"></div><div class="dial-ring r3"></div>
            <span class="dial-label top">参考姿态</span><span class="dial-label right">持续变化</span><span class="dial-label bottom">温和提醒</span>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 320 320" fill="none"><path d="M160 82c-29 0-46 22-44 48 1 19 12 32 28 39M145 169l-60 42M145 169l70 42M145 169l15 73M85 211l-20 68M215 211l28 68"></path><circle cx="160" cy="82" r="6"></circle><circle cx="116" cy="130" r="6"></circle><circle cx="145" cy="169" r="6"></circle><circle cx="85" cy="211" r="6"></circle><circle cx="215" cy="211" r="6"></circle><circle cx="160" cy="242" r="6"></circle></svg>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="how section-pad" aria-labelledby="how-title">
          <header class="section-heading">
            <div><p class="eyebrow">工作原理</p><h2 id="how-title">三步开始一次监督</h2></div>
            <a href="/zh/how-it-works/">查看完整工作原理 <span>→</span></a>
          </header>
          <ol class="process">
            <li>
              <div class="step-number">01</div>
              <div class="step-visual phone-stand" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 220 220" fill="none"><rect x="76" y="22" width="70" height="126" rx="15" transform="rotate(-5 76 22)"></rect><path d="M109 150v35M49 199h125M76 185h73"></path><path class="signal" d="M157 48l25-15M164 67h32"></path></svg></div>
              <div class="step-copy"><h3>放好设备</h3><p>把 iPhone 放在稳定支架上，让头部、肩部和上半身保持清晰可见。</p></div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div class="step-number">02</div>
              <div class="step-visual timer" aria-hidden="true"><span>40:00</span><i></i></div>
              <div class="step-copy"><h3>建立本次参考</h3><p>选择时长并开始监督。参考姿态只服务于这一次专注时间。</p></div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div class="step-number">03</div>
              <div class="step-visual bell" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 220 220" fill="none"><path d="M154 96a44 44 0 0 0-88 0c0 48-24 48-24 64h136c0-16-24-16-24-64ZM94 180h32"></path><path class="signal" d="M174 58l25-20M184 87h30M158 40l8-28"></path></svg></div>
              <div class="step-copy"><h3>变化持续时提醒</h3><p>检测到持续低头、前倾或倾斜后，用声音或震动轻轻提醒。</p></div>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </section>

        <section class="signals section-pad" aria-labelledby="signals-title">
          <div class="signals-copy">
            <p class="eyebrow light">坐姿觉察</p>
            <h2 id="signals-title">Posturely 留意的是<br /><span>持续变化</span></h2>
            <p>它比较当前可见姿态与本次监督建立的参考，而不是用一套固定标准评价每个人的身体。</p>
            <a href="/zh/features/">查看全部功能 <span>→</span></a>
          </div>
          <div class="signal-console">
            <div class="console-head"><span>SESSION SIGNAL</span><span>REFERENCE / CURRENT</span></div>
            <div class="pose-field">
              <div class="field-grid"></div>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 360 420" fill="none"><path d="M180 46c-30 0-52 23-52 54 0 25 15 44 35 50v44l-68 42-28 113M180 150l85 86 28 113M95 236l85 42 85-42M180 278v86M67 349l62 30M293 349l-62 30"></path>{[[180,46],[128,100],[163,150],[95,236],[265,236],[180,278],[67,349],[293,349],[129,379],[231,379]].map(([cx,cy]) => <circle cx={cx} cy={cy} r="7"></circle>)}</svg>
              <span class="tag head">低头</span><span class="tag shoulder">身体倾斜</span><span class="tag torso">身体前倾</span>
            </div>
            <div class="console-data"><span><i></i> 参考已建立</span><span>非医疗测量</span></div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="moments section-pad" aria-labelledby="moments-title">
          <header class="section-heading">
            <div><p class="eyebrow">桌面时刻</p><h2 id="moments-title">让提醒出现在<br />真正需要的时刻</h2></div>
            <p>不要求你改变专注方式，只在熟悉的桌面场景里多一份觉察。</p>
          </header>
          <div class="moment-index">
            <article><span>STUDY</span><h3>学习</h3><p>在作业、复习和专注学习中，留意不知不觉发生的持续变化。</p><i>01</i></article>
            <article><span>READ</span><h3>阅读</h3><p>文字越往后，提醒越安静地守在注意力之外。</p><i>02</i></article>
            <article><span>WRITE</span><h3>写作</h3><p>让注意力留在纸面或键盘，同时保留对身体的感知。</p><i>03</i></article>
            <article><span>WORK</span><h3>桌面工作</h3><p>为长时间电脑任务增加按变化触发的温和提示。</p><i>04</i></article>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-block section-pad" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
          <div class="privacy-copy">
            <p class="eyebrow">设备本地处理</p>
            <h2 id="privacy-title">画面进入检测，<br /><span>不会离开设备。</span></h2>
            <p>用于坐姿检测的摄像头画面在 iPhone 或 iPad 本地处理，不会上传到 Posturely 服务器。</p>
            <a href="/zh/privacy/">了解隐私设计 <span>→</span></a>
          </div>
          <div class="privacy-route" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="device-node"><svg viewBox="0 0 80 120" fill="none"><rect x="16" y="5" width="48" height="92" rx="10"></rect><path d="M32 13h16M34 88h12"></path></svg><small>摄像头画面</small></div>
            <div class="route-line"><span></span><i></i><strong>LOCAL</strong></div>
            <div class="lock-node"><span></span><small>本地处理</small></div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="faq section-pad" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
          <div class="faq-heading"><p class="eyebrow">常见问题</p><h2 id="faq-title">关于 Posturely</h2><a href="/zh/faq/">查看全部常见问题 <span>→</span></a></div>
          <div class="faq-list">
            <details><summary>Posturely 是什么？<span>+</span></summary><p>一款在专注桌面时间帮助你觉察坐姿变化的 iPhone 和 iPad App。</p></details>
            <details><summary>它如何检测坐姿变化？<span>+</span></summary><p>监督期间观察可见的头部与上半身变化，并与本次监督建立的参考姿态比较。</p></details>
            <details><summary>摄像头画面会上传吗？<span>+</span></summary><p>不会。用于坐姿检测的摄像头画面仅在设备本地处理。</p></details>
            <details><summary>它是医疗产品吗？<span>+</span></summary><p>不是。Posturely 用于日常坐姿觉察，不提供医疗诊断、治疗或测量。</p></details>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="final-cta section-pad">
          <p class="eyebrow light">准备开始</p>
          <h2>把坐姿觉察，<br />带进下一次专注。</h2>
          <p>只需要一部放在桌面支架上的 iPhone。</p>
          <a href={appStore.url}>前往 App Store <span>→</span></a>
          <div class="final-trace" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
        </section>
      </main>

      <footer>
        <a class="footer-brand" href="/zh/"><img src="/images/posturely-app-icon.png" width="192" height="192" alt="" /><span>Posturely</span></a>
        <p>用于坐姿觉察，不提供医疗诊断或测量。</p>
        <p>© 2026 Posturely</p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  :root {
    --signal: #b7ff1a;
    --signal-soft: #dff3c2;
    --ink: #111312;
    --device: #303431;
    --paper: #f7f8f3;
    --white: #ffffff;
    --muted: #747a75;
    --line: #d9ddd6;
    --max: 1320px;
    --display: "Arial Narrow", "Avenir Next Condensed", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
    --body: "Avenir Next", "SF Pro Text", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
    --utility: "SFMono-Regular", "Roboto Mono", "Courier New", monospace;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; background: var(--paper); }
  body { margin: 0; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--body); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  button { font: inherit; }
  .prototype { overflow: hidden; }
  .topbar { display: grid; width: min(calc(100% - 48px), var(--max)); min-height: 86px; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; align-items: center; margin: 0 auto; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .language { display: grid; width: 42px; height: 42px; cursor: pointer; place-items: center; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 50%; background: transparent; color: var(--muted); }
  .language svg { width: 20px; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .brand, .footer-brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .7rem; font-size: 1.12rem; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
  .brand img, .footer-brand img { width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 9px; }
  .header-cta { justify-self: end; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); padding: .4rem 0; font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .header-cta span, .section-heading a span, .signals-copy a span, .privacy-copy a span, .faq-heading a span { color: #5e8700; }
  .hero { display: grid; width: min(calc(100% - 48px), var(--max)); min-height: 820px; grid-template-columns: .82fr 1.18fr; align-items: center; gap: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 7rem); margin: 0 auto; padding: 5.5rem 0 6rem; }
  .kicker, .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 1.4rem; color: #526043; font-family: var(--utility); font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .13em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .kicker { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .65rem; }
  .kicker span { width: 34px; height: 2px; background: var(--signal); }
  h1, h2, h3, p { text-wrap: pretty; }
  h1 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--display); font-size: clamp(4.4rem, 6.35vw, 6.8rem); font-stretch: condensed; font-weight: 780; letter-spacing: -.075em; line-height: .98; }
  h1 em { color: #5f8508; font-style: normal; }
  .hero-intro { max-width: 600px; margin: 2rem 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.45vw, 1.18rem); line-height: 1.8; }
  .primary-cta { display: inline-flex; min-height: 58px; align-items: center; gap: 1.4rem; margin-top: 2rem; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--ink); padding: .8rem 1.5rem .8rem 1.8rem; color: var(--white); font-weight: 720; }
  .primary-cta span { display: grid; width: 30px; height: 30px; place-items: center; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--signal); color: var(--ink); }
  .cta-note { margin: 1rem 0 0; color: #969b96; font-family: var(--utility); font-size: .68rem; }
  .hero-instrument { position: relative; min-height: 640px; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--device); box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(24,28,25,.14); }
  .hero-instrument::after { position: absolute; inset: 0; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); border-radius: inherit; content: ""; pointer-events: none; }
  .hero-instrument > img { position: absolute; inset: 54px 0 0; width: 100%; height: calc(100% - 54px); object-fit: cover; object-position: 52% center; filter: saturate(.9) contrast(1.03); }
  .instrument-toolbar { position: relative; z-index: 5; display: flex; height: 54px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0 1.25rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.54); font-family: var(--utility); font-size: .62rem; letter-spacing: .09em; }
  .live { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; }
  .live i { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--signal); box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(183,255,26,.13); }
  .calibration-orbit { position: absolute; z-index: 2; right: -22%; bottom: -22%; width: 540px; height: 540px; border: 1px solid rgba(183,255,26,.34); border-radius: 50%; }
  .calibration-orbit span { position: absolute; inset: 13%; border: 1px solid rgba(183,255,26,.25); border-radius: 50%; }
  .calibration-orbit span:nth-child(2) { inset: 27%; }
  .calibration-orbit span:nth-child(3) { inset: 43%; background: rgba(183,255,26,.12); }
  .session-chip { position: absolute; z-index: 4; display: grid; gap: .2rem; min-width: 122px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2); background: rgba(17,19,18,.86); padding: .8rem 1rem; color: white; backdrop-filter: blur(12px); }
  .session-chip small { color: rgba(255,255,255,.5); font-family: var(--utility); font-size: .58rem; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .session-chip strong { font-family: var(--utility); font-size: 1rem; }
  .session-chip.time { top: 94px; left: 24px; }
  .session-chip.privacy { right: 24px; bottom: 26px; }
  .session-chip.privacy strong { color: var(--signal); }
  .posture-trace { position: absolute; z-index: 3; top: 18%; right: 6%; width: 190px; stroke: rgba(255,255,255,.76); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .posture-trace circle { fill: var(--signal); stroke: var(--device); stroke-width: 3; }
  .trace-line { stroke-dasharray: 720; animation: trace-draw 2.2s cubic-bezier(.22,.8,.22,1) both; }
  .fact-rail { display: grid; width: min(calc(100% - 48px), var(--max)); grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); margin: 0 auto; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .fact-rail article { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 44px 1fr; gap: 1.25rem; padding: 2.15rem 2rem; }
  .fact-rail article + article { border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .fact-rail article > span, .step-number { color: #6e970a; font-family: var(--utility); font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .fact-rail strong { font-size: .95rem; }
  .fact-rail p { margin: .35rem 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .75rem; }
  .section-pad { width: min(calc(100% - 48px), var(--max)); margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(7rem, 11vw, 11rem) 0; }
  .thesis { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 170px 1fr .9fr; align-items: center; gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 6rem); }
  .thesis-index { align-self: start; color: #969b96; font-family: var(--utility); font-size: .66rem; writing-mode: vertical-rl; }
  .thesis-copy h2, .section-heading h2, .signals h2, .moments h2, .privacy-block h2, .faq h2, .final-cta h2 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 760; letter-spacing: -.065em; line-height: 1.02; }
  .thesis-copy h2 { font-size: clamp(3.8rem, 6vw, 6.3rem); }
  .thesis-copy h2 span, .privacy-copy h2 span { background: linear-gradient(transparent 61%, var(--signal) 61%); }
  .thesis-copy > p:last-child { max-width: 620px; margin: 2rem 0 0; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.85; }
  .awareness-dial { position: relative; display: grid; aspect-ratio: 1; place-items: center; }
  .dial-ring { position: absolute; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 50%; }
  .dial-ring.r1 { inset: 2%; } .dial-ring.r2 { inset: 18%; } .dial-ring.r3 { inset: 35%; background: var(--white); }
  .awareness-dial svg { position: relative; z-index: 2; width: 72%; stroke: var(--ink); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .awareness-dial circle { fill: var(--signal); stroke: var(--ink); stroke-width: 2; }
  .dial-label { position: absolute; z-index: 3; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; background: var(--paper); padding: .45rem .7rem; font-family: var(--utility); font-size: .58rem; }
  .dial-label.top { top: 1%; } .dial-label.right { right: -2%; } .dial-label.bottom { bottom: 2%; }
  .how { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .section-heading { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 3rem; }
  .section-heading h2, .moments h2 { font-size: clamp(3.6rem, 5.2vw, 5.8rem); }
  .section-heading > a, .signals-copy > a, .privacy-copy > a, .faq-heading > a { border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor; padding-bottom: .3rem; font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .process { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 0; margin: 6rem 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .process::before { position: absolute; top: 15px; right: 0; left: 0; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--signal) 0 67%, var(--line) 67%); content: ""; }
  .process li { position: relative; padding: 0 clamp(1rem, 3vw, 3rem) 0 0; }
  .process li + li { padding-left: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 3rem); }
  .step-number { position: relative; z-index: 2; display: grid; width: 32px; height: 32px; place-items: center; border: 1px solid #739d10; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--paper); }
  .step-visual { display: grid; min-height: 310px; place-items: center; margin-top: 2.5rem; border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .step-visual svg { width: 70%; max-width: 230px; stroke: var(--ink); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .step-visual .signal { stroke: #6f970d; }
  .timer { position: relative; }
  .timer::before, .timer::after { position: absolute; width: 210px; height: 210px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 50%; content: ""; }
  .timer::after { width: 150px; height: 150px; border-color: #7faa13; border-top-color: transparent; transform: rotate(24deg); }
